\ @ID 09
\ @TITLE EMERALD ACID
\ @SUBTITLE 10.20.57 · DIATONIC ACID ARP
\ @CATEGORY MATH-SYNTH
\ @PARTS 4
\ @PART 1 Kick + Bass
\ @PART 2 + Arp
\ @PART 3 + Acid Line
\ @PART 4 + Hats (Full 5-Voice)
\ @SPEED 2.05
\ @FORMULA r=(3k+1) mod 7 - 3, arp=(c(digit(12031245)) mod 12 + 12*oct)/12

VARIABLE EA-K  VARIABLE EA-N  VARIABLE EA-B  VARIABLE EA-S  VARIABLE EA-R
VARIABLE EA-KICK  VARIABLE EA-BASS  VARIABLE EA-ARP  VARIABLE EA-ACID  VARIABLE EA-HAT

: EA-C ( i -- semi ) 2 I* EA-R @ + DIAT ;

: TRACK-EVAL ( x part -- )
  SWAP DUP 2.0 / FLOOR >INT DUP EA-K ! 3 I* 1 + 7 IMOD 3 - EA-R !
  DUP FRAC EA-B !
  4.0 * DUP FRAC EA-S ! FLOOR >INT 32 + EA-N !

  EA-B @ 0.3 < IF 0 EA-C F16 12.0 / 2.0 - -26.0 EA-B @ * EXP 2.6 * + ELSE QUIET THEN EA-KICK !
  EA-N @ 4 IMOD 0 > EA-S @ 0.72 < AND IF 0 EA-C F16 12.0 / 2.0 - -14.0 EA-S @ * EXP 0.22 * + ELSE QUIET THEN EA-BASS !
  12031245 7 EA-N @ 8 IMOD - DIGIT EA-C 12 IMOD EA-N @ 8 I/ 2 IMOD 12 I* + F16 12.0 / EA-ARP !
  EA-N @ 16 IMOD 3 I* F16 8.0 / FRAC 0.375 < IF
    EA-N @ 8 IMOD 3 I* 8 I/ EA-C 12 - F16 12.0 / -9.0 EA-S @ * EXP 0.3 * +
  ELSE QUIET THEN EA-ACID !
  EA-S @ 0.5 < EA-N @ 4 IMOD 2 = AND IF 2.4 EA-S @ 0.5 * - ELSE QUIET THEN EA-HAT !

  CASE
    0 OF 2 VOICES-N! EA-KICK @ 0 PRIM-SINE  EA-BASS @ 1 PRIM-TRI ENDOF
    1 OF 3 VOICES-N! EA-BASS @ 0 PRIM-TRI  EA-ARP @ 1 PRIM-SAW  EA-KICK @ 2 PRIM-SINE ENDOF
    2 OF 4 VOICES-N! EA-BASS @ 0 PRIM-TRI  EA-ARP @ 1 PRIM-SAW  EA-KICK @ 2 PRIM-SINE  EA-ACID @ 3 22.0 PRIM-SAT ENDOF
    5 VOICES-N! EA-BASS @ 0 PRIM-TRI  EA-ARP @ 1 PRIM-SAW  EA-KICK @ 2 PRIM-SINE  EA-ACID @ 3 22.0 PRIM-SAT  EA-HAT @ 4 SHIM-HIHAT
  ENDCASE ;
